### Component 2: View Switcher — Animated Tab Bar

#### [MODIFY] [ZoomViewSwitcher.tsx](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/frontend/src/features/zoom-booking/components/ZoomViewSwitcher.tsx)

**Perubahan:**

- Tambahkan `motion.div` dengan `layoutId="view-indicator"` sebagai sliding background tab
- Background active tab: subtle gradient menggunakan design token primary
- Easing: `cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1)` (strong ease-out, per Emil Kowalski)
- Duration: 200ms (snappy, per Emil: UI animations < 300ms)
- Active state: subtle `box-shadow` glow + scale feedback on `:active`
- "My Bookings" separator: animated opacity transition

