## Design Decisions

### Color Palette Alignment

Semua raw `slate-*` dan hardcoded colors akan diganti dengan design tokens:

| Before (AI Slop) | After (Design System) |
|-------------------|----------------------|
| `bg-slate-100` | `bg-[hsl(var(--secondary))]` |
| `text-slate-500` | `text-[hsl(var(--muted-foreground))]` |
| `bg-blue-600` | `bg-[hsl(var(--primary))]` |  
| `border-slate-200` | `border-[hsl(var(--border))]` |
| `bg-amber-400 to-amber-500` | `bg-[hsl(var(--accent))]` with opacity |
| `text-blue-600` | `text-[hsl(var(--primary))]` |

### Animation Philosophy (Per Emil Kowalski Skill)

| Interaction | Duration | Easing | Technique |
|-------------|----------|--------|-----------|
| Account pill switch | 200ms | `ease-out` spring | framer-motion `layoutId` |
| View tab switch | 200ms | `cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1)` | framer-motion `layoutId` |
| Calendar view transition | Enter 200ms / Exit 150ms | `ease-out` / `ease-in` | `AnimatePresence mode="wait"` |
| Month day hover | 150ms | `ease` | CSS transition |
| Event pill appear | 300ms stagger 50ms | `ease-out` | CSS keyframe |

